DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
40030::$$$message_0273_0000_0000$$$::That's right, I made a promise with Saber. Today is a day off, so it's perfect timing.[lr]::
40031::$$$message_0273_0000_0001$$$::"Saber's shoes are... All right, they're here."[lr]::
40032::$$$message_0273_0000_0002$$$::Strike while the iron is hot. I should contact Fuji-nee, who's at school, first...::
40033::$$$message_0273_0001_0000$$$::Saber and I both leave the house.[lr]::
40034::$$$message_0273_0001_0001$$$::The preparations finished surprisingly smoothly.[lr]::
40035::$$$message_0273_0001_0002$$$::I call the school and have them connect me to the kyudo club. When I bring up the school tour with Fuji-nee...[lr]::
40036::$$$message_0273_0001_0003$$$::"Hm, you wanna do it today? Sure, I'll go talk to the principal. Oh, make sure to bring lunch!"[lr]::
40037::$$$message_0273_0001_0004$$$::She casually gives the green light.::
40038::$$$message_0273_0002_0000$$$::I spent about an hour making lunch, but it is still only a little past 11 AM.[lr]::
40039::$$$message_0273_0002_0001$$$::It was something that I thought of on a whim, so the tour could've been from the afternoon, but...::
40040::$$$message_0273_0003_0000$$$::"No, if we are going to go, we should go right away![lr]::
40041::$$$message_0273_0003_0001$$$::Do not worry about my plans. [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服10a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー私服10a(中)]Let us head off!"[lr]::
40042::$$$message_0273_0003_0002$$$::Saber is aggressive for once and pushes through with it.::
40043::$$$message_0273_0004_0000$$$::"But...don't you think this is a little too sudden, Saber?"[lr]::
40044::$$$message_0273_0004_0001$$$::"...? What is it, Shirou?"[lr]::
40045::$$$message_0273_0004_0002$$$::"Do you think we hurried too much? A school tour would end in half a day, so we could've prepared a little longer."[lr]::
40046::$$$message_0273_0004_0003$$$::"No, this is enough.[lr]::
40047::$$$message_0273_0004_0004$$$::You are carefree when you go to school, so please do not be so nervous, and please go to school as you usually would."::
40048::$$$message_0273_0005_0000$$$::"As usual... All right, I'll try."[lr]::
40049::$$$message_0273_0005_0001$$$::"Yes. Then, we should hurry, Shirou. If we do not hurry, we will miss what is called 'lunch break.'"[lr]::
40050::$$$message_0273_0005_0002$$$::Saber hurries me.[lr]::
40051::$$$message_0273_0005_0003$$$::...Hmm... I wonder what Saber's excited about.::
40052::$$$message_0273_0006_0000$$$::I go up the hill as I usually do.[lr]::
40053::$$$message_0273_0006_0001$$$::I steal a glance at Saber.[lr]::
40054::$$$message_0273_0006_0002$$$::...She's making an unreadable expression.::
40055::$$$message_0273_0007_0000$$$::I'm still unable to grasp her intentions by the time we arrive at the school gate.[lr]::
40056::$$$message_0273_0007_0001$$$::"Mrgh...?"[lr]::
40057::$$$message_0273_0007_0002$$$::I don't know if it's my imagination, but the school building seems livelier than usual.::
40058::$$$message_0273_0008_0000$$$::"Shirou. Today should be a day off..."[lr]::
40059::$$$message_0273_0008_0001$$$::"Yeah... That's weird, even club activities are not this busy... Oh.[lr]::
40060::$$$message_0273_0008_0002$$$::Oh yeah, [wvl][shock vmax=10 time=400 count=-3]the cultural festival!"[lr]::
40061::$$$message_0273_0008_0003$$$::Yeah, it's almost time for the cultural festival.[lr]::
40062::$$$message_0273_0008_0004$$$::If there's a class with a big project, it isn't odd if there are several people coming to school.::
40063::$$$message_0273_0009_0000$$$::"Cultural festival...? Does that mean you hold a festival at school?"[lr]::
40064::$$$message_0273_0009_0001$$$::"Yeah. The students hold a festival once a year. It seems like there are several people at school preparing for that.[lr]::
40065::$$$message_0273_0009_0002$$$::But it's nothing to be worried about. There are still probably only like thirty people."[lr]::
40066::$$$message_0273_0009_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
40067::$$$message_0273_0009_0004$$$::Saber goes quiet all of a sudden.[lr]::
40068::$$$message_0273_0009_0005$$$::She was so confident until not too long ago, but she's suddenly restless.::
40069::$$$message_0273_0010_0000$$$::"Hm? Did you want to see a deserted school?"[lr]::
40070::$$$message_0273_0010_0001$$$::"No, that is not it... I thought that it might cause you trouble if there were other students.[lr]::
40071::$$$message_0273_0010_0002$$$::...Um, had I known, I would have borrowed a school uniform from Rin."[lr]::
40072::$$$message_0273_0010_0003$$$::"...What?"::
40073::$$$message_0273_0011_0000$$$::I'm so shocked from that statement that I switch from being touched to flabbergasted.[lr]::
40074::$$$message_0273_0011_0001$$$::Saber...wearing...the Homurahara uniform...?[lr]::
40075::$$$message_0273_0011_0002$$$::W-what is this phenomenon that I didn't even think of?[lr]::
40076::$$$message_0273_0011_0003$$$::Tohsaka's uniform would be too big for Saber[line len=2]no, I wonder if it would look good on her in the first place[line len=2]wait, if she's wearing a uniform, that would mean she would be in the same grade as me[line len=2][lr]::
40077::$$$message_0273_0011_0004$$$::"[shock vmax=10 time=300 count=-3]Let's go back, Saber. Let's go back right now. It's okay, if Tohsaka's doesn't work, then there's Sakura's[line len=2]"::
40078::$$$message_0273_0012_0000$$$::"But, come to think of it, I am a visitor.[lr]::
40079::$$$message_0273_0012_0001$$$::It would become confusing if I were wearing a Homurahara uniform."[lr]::
40080::$$$message_0273_0012_0002$$$::"Oof."[lr]::
40081::$$$message_0273_0012_0003$$$::The seek time is merely three seconds.[lr]::
40082::$$$message_0273_0012_0004$$$::Saber reaches her conclusion with the level-headedness of someone in battle.::
40083::$$$message_0273_0013_0000$$$::"I am sorry, Shirou.[lr]::
40084::$$$message_0273_0013_0001$$$::I said to be as you normally are, but I was worrying too much.[lr]::
40085::$$$message_0273_0013_0002$$$::Shirou, is there something wrong? You look like you are incredibly down."[lr]::
40086::$$$message_0273_0013_0003$$$::"...No, it's nothing.[lr]::
40087::$$$message_0273_0013_0004$$$::It's just as you said. There's no need to worry about your own clothes, so let's go inside."[wvs][clfg textoff=0 pos=all rule=シャッター左から time=400]::
40088::$$$message_0273_0014_0000$$$::My daydream ends.[lr]::
40089::$$$message_0273_0014_0001$$$::I sigh and head to school.[lr]::
40090::$$$message_0273_0014_0002$$$::Saber watches me go inside first, and naturally goes through the school gate.::
40091::$$$message_0273_0015_0000$$$::I'll go to the kyudo club for now.[lr]::
40092::$$$message_0273_0015_0001$$$::Since we arrived, Saber was bracing herself for how much she was going to stand out, so we wanted to take our time until lunch...ended...but...[lr]::
40093::$$$message_0273_0015_0002$$$::"HELP! Emiya from 3-C brought a blonde foreigner to school!!!"::
40094::$$$message_0273_0016_0000$$$::The plan falls through as soon as it starts.[lr]::
40095::$$$message_0273_0016_0001$$$::Out of everyone who could have seen us, Gai Gotou, a walking megaphone, is stretching with the track club...!::
40096::$$$message_0273_0017_0000$$$::"WHAAATTTT!?!?"[rf][lr]::
40097::$$$message_0273_0017_0001$$$::The boys of the track club go wild.[lr]::
40098::$$$message_0273_0017_0002$$$::Saber shines even from afar.[lr]::
40099::$$$message_0273_0017_0003$$$::The boy athletes, hungry for the lovely girl, form a circle like a fence and observe Saber while growling like animals.[lr]::
40100::$$$message_0273_0017_0004$$$::Inconveniently blocking the path to the kyudo club.::
40101::$$$message_0273_0018_0000$$$::"Who is that? Woah! A model? Some kind of shoot? Or my future wife that I didn't know about!?"[lr]::
40102::$$$message_0273_0018_0001$$$::"I wonder if she's our age. I hope she joins the track club, even if she doesn't go here."[lr]::
40103::$$$message_0273_0018_0002$$$::"Mm, she doesn't even have to be a girl."[lr]::
40104::$$$message_0273_0018_0003$$$::"A transfer student... It's an odd time for that. Maybe she's one of the staff. You know, our English teachers were all hot. Don't tell me, she's a substitute English teacher?"[lr]::
40105::$$$message_0273_0018_0004$$$::"A small teacher...!? Oh man, I wanna wrap her in my arms!"[lr]::
40106::$$$message_0273_0018_0005$$$::"Guh, don't say that even if it's a joke! My grades are bad, I might get held back!"::
40107::$$$message_0273_0019_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
40108::$$$message_0273_0019_0001$$$::The animals make a fuss.[lr]::
40109::$$$message_0273_0019_0002$$$::But they have no guts.[lr]::
40110::$$$message_0273_0019_0003$$$::They maintain twenty meters of distance and only observe Saber from afar.::
40111::$$$message_0273_0020_0000$$$::"Shirou... Is that the cultural festival?"[lr]::
40112::$$$message_0273_0020_0001$$$::"No. They're just an obstacle."[lr]::
40113::$$$message_0273_0020_0002$$$::But I don't exactly think they're worth any extra thought.[lr]::
40114::$$$message_0273_0020_0003$$$::They look like a crazy group, but there's a reason that they became like that.[lr]::
40115::$$$message_0273_0020_0004$$$::It's because...::
40116::$$$message_0273_0021_0000$$$::"What, no way! Hey, Yukicchi, Kane![lr]::
40117::$$$message_0273_0021_0001$$$::Over there, over there, there's Saber, it's Saber![cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服02c(遠)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=蒔寺制服02c(遠)] Wow, she's gorgeous like always, dammit!"[lr]::
40118::$$$message_0273_0021_0002$$$::A runaway train charges through, kicking the encircling crowd away.[lr]::
40119::$$$message_0273_0021_0003$$$::...Yes, because...[lr]::
40120::$$$message_0273_0021_0004$$$::The track club doesn't have enough cute girls...!::
40121::$$$message_0273_0022_0000$$$::"Yo! You've got a lot of time on your hands as always, Emiya![lr]::
40122::$$$message_0273_0022_0001$$$::So, what are you doing today? Did you come to show off that beauty to our idiots?"[lr]::
40123::$$$message_0273_0022_0002$$$::Kaede Makidera.[lr]::
40124::$$$message_0273_0022_0003$$$::This average female track club member is full of energy today, too.::
40125::$$$message_0273_0023_0000$$$::"Oh, it really is Saber and Emiya.[lr]::
40126::$$$message_0273_0023_0001$$$::Hello, long time no see. Good morning, Emiya."[lr]::
40127::$$$message_0273_0023_0002$$$::And this is Yukika Saegusa.[lr]::
40128::$$$message_0273_0023_0003$$$::She is an exceptional female member of the track club.::
40129::$$$message_0273_0024_0000$$$::"[shock vmax=10 time=400 count=-3]Yo, morning."[lr]::
40130::$$$message_0273_0024_0001$$$::"Good morning, Yukika. You remembered me."[lr]::
40131::$$$message_0273_0024_0002$$$::"Yes. I'm also happy you remember me even though we've only met once."::
40132::$$$message_0273_0025_0000$$$::The frantic atmosphere becomes peaceful at once.[lr]::
40133::$$$message_0273_0025_0001$$$::This is how the school grounds should be in the morning.::
40134::$$$message_0273_0026_0000$$$::"More light! What's up with y'all, giving Yukika all the attention and ignoring me!"[lr]::
40135::$$$message_0273_0026_0001$$$::"Long time no see, Kaede. Since you are in your school uniform, you must have finished your club practice. I am disappointed that I cannot see your wonderful running."::
40136::$$$message_0273_0027_0000$$$::"Huh? [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服01f頬(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=500][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=蒔寺制服01f頬(中)]Um. Yeah. Thanks."[lr]::
40137::$$$message_0273_0027_0001$$$::The moment Saber talks to her, Makidera pauses and starts getting self-conscious.[lr]::
40138::$$$message_0273_0027_0002$$$::It doesn't make any sense.::
40139::$$$message_0273_0028_0000$$$::"H-hey Emiya, can I ask you something?"[lr]::
40140::$$$message_0273_0028_0001$$$::"What? I'm in a hurry, so make it quick."[lr]::
40141::$$$message_0273_0028_0002$$$::"...Um, is Saber a foreigner? Her parents aren't both Japanese, right?"[lr]::
40142::$$$message_0273_0028_0003$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
40143::$$$message_0273_0028_0004$$$::I can't help but scrunch my brows.[lr]::
40144::$$$message_0273_0028_0005$$$::What is she saying?::
40145::$$$message_0273_0029_0000$$$::"You can tell just by looking at her. Saber is one hundred percent British."[lr]::
40146::$$$message_0273_0029_0001$$$::Oh... Well, I don't know if it's one hundred percent or not. Saber is mixed with something tremendous that's not human.[lr]::
40147::$$$message_0273_0029_0002$$$::"Guh, I knew it...![lr]::
40148::$$$message_0273_0029_0003$$$::W-w-what do I do, what should I do, Emiya!? [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服01g(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=蒔寺制服01g(近)]I can't speak any foreign languages!"::
40149::$$$message_0273_0030_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
40150::$$$message_0273_0030_0001$$$::I don't know what she thinks crying to me about it is going to do.[lr]::
40151::$$$message_0273_0030_0002$$$::Um, Makidera...[lr]::
40152::$$$message_0273_0030_0003$$$::"M-Maki. Saber was speaking Japanese the whole time. She said, 'long time no see.'"::
40153::$$$message_0273_0031_0000$$$::"W-whattt!? No way, didn't Saber say, [font color=0x9E0326]'Show me the prettiest one in this school. Heheheh, is it you after all, Kaede Makidera? I shall kill you now'[rf]!?"[lr]::
40154::$$$message_0273_0031_0001$$$::"...How simple things would be if that were true."::
40155::$$$message_0273_0032_0000$$$::"Oh. Himuro, you came at a good time. Please help."[lr]::
40156::$$$message_0273_0032_0001$$$::"Got it. Sorry, Emiya.[lr]::
40157::$$$message_0273_0032_0002$$$::...This small animal's sense of caution has increased from seeing an unfamiliar person. She's harmless, so don't worry."[lr]::
40158::$$$message_0273_0032_0003$$$::"Rahhh! Who are you calling a monkey!? ...[cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服01g(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=500][chgfg time=200 storage=蒔寺制服01g(中)]Could it be you, Yukicchi!?"::
40159::$$$message_0273_0033_0000$$$::"By the way, what are you two doing today?"[lr]::
40160::$$$message_0273_0033_0001$$$::"Oh, well..."[lr]::
40161::$$$message_0273_0033_0002$$$::Wow.[lr]::
40162::$$$message_0273_0033_0003$$$::She just casually ignored her right now.::
40163::$$$message_0273_0034_0000$$$::"I came to take a tour of the school. Shirou is showing me around."[lr]::
40164::$$$message_0273_0034_0001$$$::"Huh? Who is Shirou? ...[cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服01g(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=500][chgfg time=200 storage=蒔寺制服01g(中)]Could it be you, Yukicchi!?"::
40165::$$$message_0273_0035_0000$$$::"Wow. So are you going to possibly transfer here, Saber?"[lr]::
40166::$$$message_0273_0035_0001$$$::...How impressive.[lr]::
40167::$$$message_0273_0035_0002$$$::Saegusa has no malicious intent. I can only describe this as her having gotten instinctively accustomed to Makidera's comedic nature.::
40168::$$$message_0273_0036_0000$$$::"I'm joking...![lr]::
40169::$$$message_0273_0036_0001$$$::I'm sad, someone respond to me! I don't care if you call me a monkey, so give me attention!"[lr]::
40170::$$$message_0273_0036_0002$$$::"Oh. Maki, Emiya's first name is Shirou. You didn't know since you're in a different class, right?"[lr]::
40171::$$$message_0273_0036_0003$$$::"Wahh... You're so kind, Yukicchi...[lr]::
40172::$$$message_0273_0036_0004$$$::But I refuse to remember Emiya's name."::
40173::$$$message_0273_0037_0000$$$::"...I apologize again. Makidera is a coward who just has to act like the bad guy."[lr]::
40174::$$$message_0273_0037_0001$$$::"Excuse me!? Whose side are you on, [wvl][shock vmax=15 time=300 count=-3]Kane!?"[lr]::
40175::$$$message_0273_0037_0002$$$::"I'm more on the side of whoever's quieter.[lr]::
40176::$$$message_0273_0037_0003$$$::Now. Saber, is it true that you are taking a tour in order to transfer?"::
40177::$$$message_0273_0038_0000$$$::"No, that is not the reason why I came.[lr]::
40178::$$$message_0273_0038_0001$$$::I just wanted to try going inside this school."[lr]::
40179::$$$message_0273_0038_0002$$$::"Y-yeah. Fuji-n[line len=2]Ms. Fujimura said that those kinds of interactions are important."[lr]::
40180::$$$message_0273_0038_0003$$$::"Ms. Fujimura did? ...I see. She's in charge of English. I can see how she would get that idea."::
40181::$$$message_0273_0039_0000$$$::"Huh? So what does that mean, Kane?"[lr]::
40182::$$$message_0273_0039_0001$$$::"In simple terms, it means cultural exchange.[lr]::
40183::$$$message_0273_0039_0002$$$::She is most likely trying to have Saber, who grew up in a different living environment from us, learn about a different kind of life that she otherwise would not know[line len=2]"[lr]::
40184::$$$message_0273_0039_0003$$$::"Uh-huh."::
40185::$$$message_0273_0040_0000$$$::"I won't say who, but I believe the idea was to have someone lose their insecurity towards foreign languages by having them interact with foreigners."[lr]::
40186::$$$message_0273_0040_0001$$$::"Wow, way to go, Ms. Fujimura.[lr]::
40187::$$$message_0273_0040_0002$$$::I thought she was just a cool hooligan!"[lr]::
40188::$$$message_0273_0040_0003$$$::...Makidera must resonate with her as kindred spirits... ::
40189::$$$message_0273_0041_0000$$$::"I see, so Taiga was thinking that far ahead as an educator."[lr]::
40190::$$$message_0273_0041_0001$$$::"...Well, she is an actual teacher after all."[lr]::
40191::$$$message_0273_0041_0002$$$::She may spend the vast majority of her life having fun, but she becomes a wise person when it's important.[lr]::
40192::$$$message_0273_0041_0003$$$::The reason that the permission to visit got approved easily was also because Fuji-nee had taken action beforehand.::
40193::$$$message_0273_0042_0000$$$::"By the way, Emiya. What's that bag?"[lr]::
40194::$$$message_0273_0042_0001$$$::"This is the lunch Ms. Fujimura asked me about. I'm going to go deliver it to the range."[lr]::
40195::$$$message_0273_0042_0002$$$::"Then you should hurry and deliver it. We'll drive away the male members hanging around over there."[lr]::
40196::$$$message_0273_0042_0003$$$::"Yeah. They're ditching practice and just talking about stupid stuff. [cacheimage storage=蒔寺制服03b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=蒔寺制服03b(中)]That's why they always lose in the preliminaries."::
40197::$$$message_0273_0043_0000$$$::"Then we will excuse ourselves. Please take your time, Saber."[lr]::
40198::$$$message_0273_0043_0001$$$::"Yes, Yukika. Please do not push yourself either."[lr]::
40199::$$$message_0273_0043_0002$$$::She bows and follows after the other two... No, she goes to stop Makidera from bullying the guys.[lr]::
40200::$$$message_0273_0043_0003$$$::They are a trio with a miraculous balance.::
40201::$$$message_0273_0044_0000$$$::"All right then. Let's go deliver her lunch."[lr]::
40202::$$$message_0273_0044_0001$$$::"Yes. So the archery range first, correct?"::
40203::$$$message_0273_0045_0000$$$::Today's practice must be starting in the afternoon, as the dojo is empty.[lr]::
40204::$$$message_0273_0045_0001$$$::In the middle of the dojo where no general members have arrived yet, the collapsed tiger that was on the floor jumps up.::
40205::$$$message_0273_0046_0000$$$::"You're late, Shirou! I got so tired of waiting that I thought I would turn into a rug."[lr]::
40206::$$$message_0273_0046_0001$$$::...She already did.[lr]::
40207::$$$message_0273_0046_0002$$$::Fuji-nee had unmistakably turned into something like that.::
40208::$$$message_0273_0047_0000$$$::"Sorry for making you wait, but you're the one who ordered this much. Obviously, you would have to wait one or two hours."[lr]::
40209::$$$message_0273_0047_0001$$$::I put down, or more like stack, the lunch boxes that I brought.[lr]::
40210::$$$message_0273_0047_0002$$$::It's enough food for about six people.::
40211::$$$message_0273_0048_0000$$$::"Well done, well done. Good work, Shirou.[lr]::
40212::$$$message_0273_0048_0001$$$::Hmm, this should be enough. Lunch for me, Sakura, Shirou, Saber, and Mitsuzuri."[lr]::
40213::$$$message_0273_0048_0002$$$::"Taiga, am I going to have lunch here, too?"[lr]::
40214::$$$message_0273_0048_0003$$$::"That's right. You came to tour the school, so you might as well do things that you usually can't do."::
40215::$$$message_0273_0049_0000$$$::"However, I am an outsider[line len=2]"[lr]::
40216::$$$message_0273_0049_0001$$$::"Don't worry about the small things.[lr]::
40217::$$$message_0273_0049_0002$$$::You're a guest that came to visit, so you're not an outsider or anything. You're Shirou's guardian, I mean, family after all. If we had a class observation day, I would want you to come."::
40218::$$$message_0273_0050_0000$$$::"Me being Shirou's relative?[lr]::
40219::$$$message_0273_0050_0001$$$::I suppose that is how it would be..."[lr]::
40220::$$$message_0273_0050_0002$$$::"It's fine. Rider is usually with you, but she also goes somewhere else sometimes.[lr]::
40221::$$$message_0273_0050_0003$$$::You're all alone when that happens, right? Sooo you need to do something like this every now and then."::
40222::$$$message_0273_0051_0000$$$::"...Taiga.[lr]::
40223::$$$message_0273_0051_0001$$$::Thank you, I appreciate your consideration.[lr]::
40224::$$$message_0273_0051_0002$$$::Including the matter from earlier, you are even more dependable than usual today. I can hardly recognize you at school."[lr]::
40225::$$$message_0273_0051_0003$$$::"Yep, yep."[lr]::
40226::$$$message_0273_0051_0004$$$::I agree from the bottom of my heart behind Saber.::
40227::$$$message_0273_0052_0000$$$::"Welcome, Senpai and Saber."[lr]::
40228::$$$message_0273_0052_0001$$$::"Yo, thanks for coming. I heard you're treating us to lunch."[lr]::
40229::$$$message_0273_0052_0002$$$::"Excuse us. So, you two also have club practice today?"::
40230::$$$message_0273_0053_0000$$$::"Yes, it's in the afternoon today. I was having a meeting about the cultural festival with Mitsuzuri-senpai in the morning."[lr]::
40231::$$$message_0273_0053_0001$$$::"Geez, we didn't decide on a single thing though.[lr]::
40232::$$$message_0273_0053_0002$$$::We're in trouble... The number of applications for food and drinks have exceeded the limit, and a lot of our members are too clumsy to perform for some reason."[lr]::
40233::$$$message_0273_0053_0003$$$::"I'm sorry... I'm probably the most clumsy one..."::
40234::$$$message_0273_0054_0000$$$::"Oh, no, we'll manage. We've got Minori, so we could always make him dance if worst comes to worst... [cacheimage storage=美綴02d(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=200 storage=美綴02d(中)]Wait, hold on. If we do a performance, we have a master right here.[lr]::
40235::$$$message_0273_0054_0001$$$::Hey, Saber, are you free on the day of the cultural festival? If you don't have any plans, I'm wondering if you can help us out a bit."[lr]::
40236::$$$message_0273_0054_0002$$$::"Huh? [wvl canskip=0 time=500]M-me?"::
40237::$$$message_0273_0055_0000$$$::"Yeah. If you're okay with it, would you be able to lend a hand with our performance?[lr]::
40238::$$$message_0273_0055_0001$$$::You're skillful and look good on stage. And most of all, I want to see your swordplay, which not even Ms. Fujimura can beat, more than anyone else."[lr]::
40239::$$$message_0273_0055_0002$$$::"..."::
40240::$$$message_0273_0056_0000$$$::Saber seems to be having trouble answering, as she has her mouth shut.[lr]::
40241::$$$message_0273_0056_0001$$$::"Wait, Mitsuzuri. You're just troubling Saber by asking her something like that all of a sudden.[lr]::
40242::$$$message_0273_0056_0002$$$::First off, Saber's not a kyudo club member."[lr]::
40243::$$$message_0273_0056_0003$$$::"But she's involved. Ms. Fujimura just said that Saber is your relative.[lr]::
40244::$$$message_0273_0056_0004$$$::There's nothing weird about her performing in our cultural festival."::
40245::$$$message_0273_0057_0000$$$::She says confidently.[lr]::
40246::$$$message_0273_0057_0001$$$::"Mrgh... That's[line len=2]"[lr]::
40247::$$$message_0273_0057_0002$$$::"What? Or are you against it? Saber being in our cultural festival?"[lr]::
40248::$$$message_0273_0057_0003$$$::"Idio[line len=2]Of course [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3]not![lr]::
40249::$$$message_0273_0057_0004$$$::I-if Saber wears a Homurahara uniform, there'll be nothing left for me to regret in my whole three years of school life!"[lr]::
40250::$$$message_0273_0057_0005$$$::"It's decided then.[lr]::
40251::$$$message_0273_0057_0006$$$::Come on, Saber, think about it. Ms. Fujimura and Emiya are both saying so too."::
40252::$$$message_0273_0058_0000$$$::"Yes, I will do my best.[lr]::
40253::$$$message_0273_0058_0001$$$::I would be glad to if you'll have me."[lr]::
40254::$$$message_0273_0058_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
40255::$$$message_0273_0058_0003$$$::Saber's voice is soft.[lr]::
40256::$$$message_0273_0058_0004$$$::...I wonder why. I don't have any worries, yet my heart aches for a moment.::
40257::$$$message_0273_0059_0000$$$::"Okay! Now that it's decided, let's have lunch![lr]::
40258::$$$message_0273_0059_0001$$$::Come on, Shirou, open up the lunch. I'm starving, so hurry!"[lr]::
40259::$$$message_0273_0059_0002$$$::"Khh, you ruined the ending of a good conversation.[lr]::
40260::$$$message_0273_0059_0003$$$::All right, fine. Sakura, can you help me prepare the tea?"[lr]::
40261::$$$message_0273_0059_0004$$$::"Yes."[lr]::
40262::$$$message_0273_0059_0005$$$::"It's okay, Emiya. I'll do it.[lr]::
40263::$$$message_0273_0059_0006$$$::We're being treated to lunch, so we can do that much."::
40264::$$$message_0273_0060_0000$$$::"Okay. Then... Sakura, can you prepare the lunch and keep Fuji-nee company? ...Make sure to keep watch."[lr]::
40265::$$$message_0273_0060_0001$$$::"Mrgh, what do you mean by that, Shirou?"[lr]::
40266::$$$message_0273_0060_0002$$$::"Yes, I won't let her get a head start on a single piece.[lr]::
40267::$$$message_0273_0060_0003$$$::Well then, let's open up the lunch, Ms. Fujimura."[lr]::
40268::$$$message_0273_0060_0004$$$::"Yeah, I wonder what we're having today."::
40269::$$$message_0273_0061_0000$$$::We finish eating lunch and leave the archery range.[lr]::
40270::$$$message_0273_0061_0001$$$::The layered lunch boxes would have gotten in the way, so we left them behind.[lr]::
40271::$$$message_0273_0061_0002$$$::I leave them for Fuji-nee to bring back, and we continue touring the campus.::
40272::$$$message_0273_0062_0000$$$::"Thank you for the food.[lr]::
40273::$$$message_0273_0062_0001$$$::It is also nice to have lunch like that sometimes, Shirou."[lr]::
40274::$$$message_0273_0062_0002$$$::"I'm glad you enjoyed it.[lr]::
40275::$$$message_0273_0062_0003$$$::...I actually wanted to eat on the rooftop. But we can do that another time."[lr]::
40276::$$$message_0273_0062_0004$$$::"Yes. Then, let us eat on the rooftop next time.[lr]::
40277::$$$message_0273_0062_0005$$$::According to Rin, I heard that you have lunch on the rooftop or in the student council room."[wvs][clfg pos=all textoff=0 rule=シャッター左から time=400]::
40278::$$$message_0273_0063_0000$$$::We leave the archery range.[lr]::
40279::$$$message_0273_0063_0001$$$::Next stop... Well, she just mentioned it, so we should go to the student council room.[lr]::
40280::$$$message_0273_0063_0002$$$::There are some students here and there on campus, so Issei should be here too.::
40281::$$$message_0273_0064_0000$$$::We head to the student council room.[lr]::
40282::$$$message_0273_0064_0001$$$::I've gotten used to the shrill squeals that I hear every time we pass by students in the hallway or pass by classrooms.[lr]::
40283::$$$message_0273_0064_0002$$$::Either Saber's gotten used to the stares, or she hasn't noticed.[lr]::
40284::$$$message_0273_0064_0003$$$::She's calmly walking through the campus, which is more crowded than it would be on a typical weekend.::
40285::$$$message_0273_0065_0000$$$::"...Hm?"[lr]::
40286::$$$message_0273_0065_0001$$$::"Oh."[lr]::
40287::$$$message_0273_0065_0002$$$::There...[lr]::
40288::$$$message_0273_0065_0003$$$::We run into Mr. Kuzuki.[lr]::
40289::$$$message_0273_0065_0004$$$::We're at school, so this isn't anything out of the ordinary.::
40290::$$$message_0273_0066_0000$$$::"Good morning."[lr]::
40291::$$$message_0273_0066_0001$$$::"Morning. [cacheimage storage=葛木02a眼鏡(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=葛木02a眼鏡(中)]I suppose it is past that time. Are you doing well, Emiya?"[lr]::
40292::$$$message_0273_0066_0002$$$::There's a strange tension.[lr]::
40293::$$$message_0273_0066_0003$$$::Saber's expression also seems to be rigid.::
40294::$$$message_0273_0067_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
40295::$$$message_0273_0067_0001$$$::Mr. Kuzuki is staring straight at Saber.[lr]::
40296::$$$message_0273_0067_0002$$$::He's not a mage, but he's Caster's Master.[lr]::
40297::$$$message_0273_0067_0003$$$::He may have taken Saber being at school as a sign of battle.::
40298::$$$message_0273_0068_0000$$$::"Mr. Kuzuki, Saber is[line len=2]"[lr]::
40299::$$$message_0273_0068_0001$$$::"I heard from Ms. Fujimura. Take your time and show her around until the school closes."[lr]::
40300::$$$message_0273_0068_0002$$$::"Oh, yes. Thank you."[lr]::
40301::$$$message_0273_0068_0003$$$::...I was the one misunderstanding.[lr]::
40302::$$$message_0273_0068_0004$$$::This person isn't someone who would start a fight without a good reason.::
40303::$$$message_0273_0069_0000$$$::"Thanks for your help on that occasion. Please keep in touch with her from now on as well."[lr]::
40304::$$$message_0273_0069_0001$$$::"I will if I have time."[lr]::
40305::$$$message_0273_0069_0002$$$::Mr. Kuzuki leaves.[lr]::
40306::$$$message_0273_0069_0003$$$::His footsteps are silent, and his midline is brilliantly unwavering as usual, but...::
40307::$$$message_0273_0070_0000$$$::"Hold on a sec. What was that, Saber?"[lr]::
40308::$$$message_0273_0070_0001$$$::Why is Kuzuki thanking Saber "for that occasion"!?[lr]::
40309::$$$message_0273_0070_0002$$$::"...It is nothing special.[lr]::
40310::$$$message_0273_0070_0003$$$::Caster sometimes calls me over, and I only help out with her side job."::
40311::$$$message_0273_0071_0000$$$::"S-side job...!? [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-3]Caster has a side job!?[lr]::
40312::$$$message_0273_0071_0001$$$::W-w-what is that totally suspicious explanation!? S-she was never pressed for money!"[lr]::
40313::$$$message_0273_0071_0002$$$::She's a rare mage after all.[lr]::
40314::$$$message_0273_0071_0003$$$::Changing copper to gold like an alchemist should be a piece of cake.::
40315::$$$message_0273_0072_0000$$$::"I think so too, but I believe that working to make your life richer and working to make your spirit richer are two different things.[lr]::
40316::$$$message_0273_0072_0001$$$::...Goodness. I do not know where they are receiving orders from, but those sorts of dresses were not common even during my time."[wvs][clfg textoff=0 pos=all rule=シャッター左から time=400]::
40317::$$$message_0273_0073_0000$$$::Saber complains.[lr]::
40318::$$$message_0273_0073_0001$$$::...But...[lr]::
40319::$$$message_0273_0073_0002$$$::"...Well, that's that, and it is a rewarding job..."[lr]::
40320::$$$message_0273_0073_0003$$$::It seems like Saber doesn't feel bad about it.::
40321::$$$message_0273_0074_0000$$$::"Excuse me. Oh, it's just you, Issei."[lr]::
40322::$$$message_0273_0074_0001$$$::"Oh. I was wondering who it was, but it's you, Emiya."[lr]::
40323::$$$message_0273_0074_0002$$$::He looks up from his folder and calculator and looks over at us.::
40324::$$$message_0273_0075_0000$$$::"I didn't expect you to be with Saber.[lr]::
40325::$$$message_0273_0075_0001$$$::I see, so the visitor that I was contacted about was Saber."[lr]::
40326::$$$message_0273_0075_0002$$$::Issei nods with a smile.[lr]::
40327::$$$message_0273_0075_0003$$$::Issei gives a sour look to every girl, but it seems like only Saber is his favorite.[lr]::
40328::$$$message_0273_0075_0004$$$::According to him, he feels divinity from her.::
40329::$$$message_0273_0076_0000$$$::"I shall pour you tea. Please make yourself at home, Saber."[lr]::
40330::$$$message_0273_0076_0001$$$::"Thank you. Long time no see, Issei."[lr]::
40331::$$$message_0273_0076_0002$$$::"Is it okay? We can come back later if you're busy."[lr]::
40332::$$$message_0273_0076_0003$$$::"I don't mind. It's all miscellaneous business. It's nothing that I have to get done right away."[wvs][clfg textoff=0 rule=シャッター左から time=400 storage=一成03a(中)]::
40333::$$$message_0273_0077_0000$$$::I leave the tea up to Issei and sit on the chairs with Saber.[lr]::
40334::$$$message_0273_0077_0001$$$::We hear the hustle and bustle of the club activities from the window.::
40335::$$$message_0273_0078_0000$$$::"So, Emiya. I heard you brought Saber to take a tour, but why here? I don't think there's anything in particular to see."[lr]::
40336::$$$message_0273_0078_0001$$$::"That is not true.[lr]::
40337::$$$message_0273_0078_0002$$$::I heard about the student council room and you from Shirou, so I was interested in what kind of place it was."[lr]::
40338::$$$message_0273_0078_0003$$$::"Is that so? ...How unfortunate. Had I known that you two were going to come, I would have bought some high-quality snacks."::
40339::$$$message_0273_0079_0000$$$::"It's fine, you don't have to worry about it.[lr]::
40340::$$$message_0273_0079_0001$$$::We just ate too. Having tea to rest our throats is the best treat."[lr]::
40341::$$$message_0273_0079_0002$$$::"I see, that's good.[lr]::
40342::$$$message_0273_0079_0003$$$::But where did you have lunch? The cafeteria is closed, right?"::
40343::$$$message_0273_0080_0000$$$::"At the archery range. Shirou made us lunch."[lr]::
40344::$$$message_0273_0080_0001$$$::"Wow... Mrgh, we must have missed each other.[lr]::
40345::$$$message_0273_0080_0002$$$::I went to the archery range this morning."[lr]::
40346::$$$message_0273_0080_0003$$$::"You missed out on Shirou's lunch."[lr]::
40347::$$$message_0273_0080_0004$$$::"Quite so. But it can't be helped. How unfortunate."::
40348::$$$message_0273_0081_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
40349::$$$message_0273_0081_0001$$$::Saber and Issei get along rather well.[lr]::
40350::$$$message_0273_0081_0002$$$::I'm only realizing this now, but they might be similar by nature.::
40351::$$$message_0273_0082_0000$$$::"Now... There are a lot of students today because it is before the cultural festival, but I am sure that they gladly welcome your visit.[lr]::
40352::$$$message_0273_0082_0001$$$::It is a good opportunity, so please go around the school building. [cacheimage storage=一成02b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=一成02b(中)]Well, if only the student council room were a bit more entertaining."[lr]::
40353::$$$message_0273_0082_0002$$$::"No, please do not say that.[lr]::
40354::$$$message_0273_0082_0003$$$::If possible, I would like to rest here a little longer."::
40355::$$$message_0273_0083_0000$$$::He nods at Saber's words.[lr]::
40356::$$$message_0273_0083_0001$$$::There's still time, so we should hang here a bit longer.::
40357::$$$message_0273_0084_0000$$$::"Is that so? Then, we can make a bit more small talk.[lr]::
40358::$$$message_0273_0084_0001$$$::Instead of about the school, should I talk about Emiya at school?"[lr]::
40359::$$$message_0273_0084_0002$$$::Saber exclaims in wonder at that.[lr]::
40360::$$$message_0273_0084_0003$$$::But I can't stand the idea of being their topic of conversation for the day.::
40361::$$$message_0273_0085_0000$$$::"W-[wvl][se storage=se308.wav][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-3]wait, Issei, what are you planning to tell her?"[lr]::
40362::$$$message_0273_0085_0001$$$::"There's no need to be flustered, although I should have thought of doing that in the first place. First off, is there anything that you would be embarrassed with her knowing? Are you committing any wrongdoings?"[lr]::
40363::$$$message_0273_0085_0002$$$::"Well, it's not that, but[line len=2]"::
40364::$$$message_0273_0086_0000$$$::"Oh. Shirou, is there something that you do not want me to hear?"[lr]::
40365::$$$message_0273_0086_0001$$$::"N-no, I'm not hiding anything."[lr]::
40366::$$$message_0273_0086_0002$$$::"Then, it is decided.[lr]::
40367::$$$message_0273_0086_0003$$$::Please, Issei."::
40368::$$$message_0273_0087_0000$$$::"Oof..."[lr]::
40369::$$$message_0273_0087_0001$$$::They decided what they're going to do, whether I like it or not... Those two really get along well.::
40370::$$$message_0273_0088_0000$$$::"Now. Even though I said that, I wonder what I should talk about. There are too many stories to choose from."[lr]::
40371::$$$message_0273_0088_0001$$$::"I heard that Shirou helps out here, but what kinds of things does he help out with?"::
40372::$$$message_0273_0089_0000$$$::"Let's see... Basically repairing public property.[lr]::
40373::$$$message_0273_0089_0001$$$::We're not able to buy replacements right away just because something breaks, so it helps out a lot."[lr]::
40374::$$$message_0273_0089_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
40375::$$$message_0273_0089_0003$$$::I don't like this... It's embarrassing like a parent-teacher conference...[lr]::
40376::$$$message_0273_0089_0004$$$::I wouldn't mind if it were Kiritsugu or Fuji-nee, but it's strangely embarrassing having Saber hear this.::
40377::$$$message_0273_0090_0000$$$::"I see. That is certainly Shirou's field of expertise."[lr]::
40378::$$$message_0273_0090_0001$$$::"There's nothing else really in particular, but I get Emiya's help for every event.[lr]::
40379::$$$message_0273_0090_0002$$$::Actually, I feel like he's always helping someone out whenever I look in his direction."[lr]::
40380::$$$message_0273_0090_0003$$$::"Oh, I see. That is very much like Shirou."::
40381::$$$message_0273_0091_0000$$$::"Hahaha. Yeah, I think so too. That's Emiya for you."[lr]::
40382::$$$message_0273_0091_0001$$$::"It is really troubling.[lr]::
40383::$$$message_0273_0091_0002$$$::...So, Issei, what kinds of stories do you have, to be specific?"[lr]::
40384::$$$message_0273_0091_0003$$$::"Indeed. This may take a while, so I should start with the funny ones."[lr]::
40385::$$$message_0273_0091_0004$$$::The model students liven up.[lr]::
40386::$$$message_0273_0091_0005$$$::...Whatever, do what you want...::
40387::$$$message_0273_0092_0000$$$::...This torture continues for an hour.[lr]::
40388::$$$message_0273_0092_0001$$$::The two of them are still going strong as the sun begins to set. We still haven't gone around the school, so I ask them to let me off the hook.::
40389::$$$message_0273_0093_0000$$$::"Well, sorry for holding you up.[lr]::
40390::$$$message_0273_0093_0001$$$::Please enjoy the rest of your campus tour."[lr]::
40391::$$$message_0273_0093_0002$$$::"No, it was very valuable. I was able to find out about a different side than the Shirou that Taiga talks about."[lr]::
40392::$$$message_0273_0093_0003$$$::"Hahaha. Well, if you enjoyed this conversation as much as I did, I would be happy to talk with you as much as you would like.[lr]::
40393::$$$message_0273_0093_0004$$$::Please come to the temple if there is anything you need. I would be able to welcome you properly there."[lr]::
40394::$$$message_0273_0093_0005$$$::"Yes, if there is an opportunity, then I would love to."::
40395::$$$message_0273_0094_0000$$$::"...Issei. Are you still not done talking?"[lr]::
40396::$$$message_0273_0094_0001$$$::"Of course not. The album in my heart holds three years' worth. I only opened the first book today. The next will be the long-awaited second year..."[lr]::
40397::$$$message_0273_0094_0002$$$::"...Let's go, Saber.[lr]::
40398::$$$message_0273_0094_0003$$$::I didn't know that Issei was this talkative. We'll have to keep him company until he's shared everything he knows at this rate."::
40399::$$$message_0273_0095_0000$$$::"Y-yes.[lr]::
40400::$$$message_0273_0095_0001$$$::Well then, Issei, I will see you later."[lr]::
40401::$$$message_0273_0095_0002$$$::"Yes, the second year has the long-awaited main event, the summer training camp, in store... [cacheimage storage=一成04a(中)][wvl][se storage=se308.wav][shock vmax=20 time=500 count=-4][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=一成04a(中)]They disappeared![lr]::
40402::$$$message_0273_0095_0003$$$::...Wait... Was I getting carried away and showing some shameful conduct...!?"::
40403::$$$message_0273_0096_0000$$$::The afternoon goes by peacefully.[lr]::
40404::$$$message_0273_0096_0001$$$::Various special classrooms like the music room and audio-visual room, the gymnasium and library, the student cafeteria...[lr]::
40405::$$$message_0273_0096_0002$$$::[se volume=50 storage=se020.wav]Showing Saber, who doesn't know what school is, around was more fun and rewarding than I thought.::
40406::$$$message_0273_0097_0000$$$::And it's evening.[lr]::
40407::$$$message_0273_0097_0001$$$::As students start to leave, and as we're also about to leave...[lr]::
40408::$$$message_0273_0097_0002$$$::"I would like to see your classroom last."[lr]::
40409::$$$message_0273_0097_0003$$$::Saber mentions a place that she wants to go to for the first time today.::
40410::$$$message_0273_0098_0000$$$::"So this is your classroom.[lr]::
40411::$$$message_0273_0098_0001$$$::...It looks exactly the same as the other classrooms."[lr]::
40412::$$$message_0273_0098_0002$$$::"Of course. I told you all the classrooms are the same. The only things that differentiate each class are the bulletin board in the back or the scratches on the desks."[lr]::
40413::$$$message_0273_0098_0003$$$::"Oh, I see.[lr]::
40414::$$$message_0273_0098_0004$$$::Then your desk is...[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服13b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー私服13b(中)]this one?"::
40415::$$$message_0273_0099_0000$$$::I don't know what kind of instincts she has, but she accurately guesses my desk.[lr]::
40416::$$$message_0273_0099_0001$$$::"Hm. In the middle of this neat desk is this awful crack. How tragic... It is as though an iron hammer fell onto it.[lr]::
40417::$$$message_0273_0099_0002$$$::Shirou, what is this...?"[lr]::
40418::$$$message_0273_0099_0003$$$::"That's the mark Fuji-nee made when she tripped, fell, and head-butted my desk. She continued teaching while shedding blood the whole time."[lr]::
40419::$$$message_0273_0099_0004$$$::That was the first Fujimura legend from when I became a third year.::
40420::$$$message_0273_0100_0000$$$::"I-I see.[lr]::
40421::$$$message_0273_0100_0001$$$::I did not think it would be like you to leave a mark as a prank...[lr]::
40422::$$$message_0273_0100_0002$$$::If you say that Taiga did it, that is also very much like you."[wvs][clfg textoff=0 pos=all rule=シャッター左から time=400]::
40423::$$$message_0273_0101_0000$$$::Saber says happily and walks around the classroom.[lr]::
40424::$$$message_0273_0101_0001$$$::It should be a classroom with nothing to see, yet Saber seems the most happy she's been today.[lr]::
40425::$$$message_0273_0101_0002$$$::That makes me wonder...::
40426::$$$message_0273_0102_0000$$$::"Hey, Saber.[lr]::
40427::$$$message_0273_0102_0001$$$::It's kinda late to ask, but why were you interested in the school?"[lr]::
40428::$$$message_0273_0102_0002$$$::I ask her the question that crossed my mind this morning.::
40429::$$$message_0273_0103_0000$$$::"There is no big reason.[lr]::
40430::$$$message_0273_0103_0001$$$::I just got curious to know what your school life is like.[lr]::
40431::$$$message_0273_0103_0002$$$::Thanks to you and Taiga, I was able to come here directly."::
40432::$$$message_0273_0104_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
40433::$$$message_0273_0104_0001$$$::I see. But, not even half of that request was granted.[lr]::
40434::$$$message_0273_0104_0002$$$::Saber said "school life."[lr]::
40435::$$$message_0273_0104_0003$$$::What she wanted to see was not the building, but the everyday life inside.::
40436::$$$message_0273_0105_0000$$$::"Maybe you should've come on a weekday. You wanted to see some classes, right?"[lr]::
40437::$$$message_0273_0105_0001$$$::"Yes. I would want to sit in class.[lr]::
40438::$$$message_0273_0105_0002$$$::But, I cannot turn into spirit form."[lr]::
40439::$$$message_0273_0105_0003$$$::"You don't have to turn into spirit form.[lr]::
40440::$$$message_0273_0105_0004$$$::Better yet, why don't you just transfer? Tohsaka seems like she would be able to prepare a family register or other paperwork."::
40441::$$$message_0273_0106_0000$$$::Saber nods in agreement.[lr]::
40442::$$$message_0273_0106_0001$$$::"That sounds wonderful. I did not even think of that."[lr]::
40443::$$$message_0273_0106_0002$$$::"Right? All right, let's try discussing it with Tohsaka once we get home.[lr]::
40444::$$$message_0273_0106_0003$$$::I'm sure she would set things up so easily that it would surprise us, and Fuji-nee would cooperate too."::
40445::$$$message_0273_0107_0000$$$::I keep on talking like an idiot, as if I'm delirious with a fever.[lr]::
40446::$$$message_0273_0107_0001$$$::"Yes. I will be looking forward to it, Shirou."[lr]::
40447::$$$message_0273_0107_0002$$$::Saber answers with a smile.[lr]::
40448::$$$message_0273_0107_0003$$$::...I wonder what kind of meaning that smile had.[lr]::
40449::$$$message_0273_0107_0004$$$::I still don't know the difference between a promise and a wish.::
40450::$$$message_0273_0108_0000$$$::And just like that, our short break comes to an end.[lr]::
40451::$$$message_0273_0108_0001$$$::We peacefully walk along the way back home, with the same feelings as when it started.::
40452::$$$message_0273_0109_0000$$$::The town that we look down upon from the hill is a different view than usual.[lr]::
40453::$$$message_0273_0109_0001$$$::No, the view is always different.[lr]::
40454::$$$message_0273_0109_0002$$$::There are just enough opportunities to notice that usually.::
40455::$$$message_0273_0110_0000$$$::Saber pauses and softly stares at the town.[lr]::
40456::$$$message_0273_0110_0001$$$::"Is there something wrong, Saber?"[lr]::
40457::$$$message_0273_0110_0002$$$::I try to act as natural as possible.[lr]::
40458::$$$message_0273_0110_0003$$$::I call out to her as I usually do, so that I don't ruin the fun day.::
40459::$$$message_0273_0111_0000$$$::"No, there is nothing that stands out.[lr]::
40460::$$$message_0273_0111_0001$$$::This is the usual Fuyuki City that we know."[lr]::
40461::$$$message_0273_0111_0002$$$::A nice breeze is blowing.[lr]::
40462::$$$message_0273_0111_0003$$$::Her blond hair is flowing in the wind.[lr]::
40463::$$$message_0273_0111_0004$$$::The fun day we had is about to end.::
40464::$$$message_0273_0112_0000$$$::"Let's go home then. You don't see anything strange, right?"[lr]::
40465::$$$message_0273_0112_0001$$$::"No. But I would like to look at this view a little longer.[lr]::
40466::$$$message_0273_0112_0002$$$::In order to remember this view forever."[lr]::
40467::$$$message_0273_0112_0003$$$::"How dramatic. There's no need for that. You can come here again tomorrow."::
40468::$$$message_0273_0113_0000$$$::Not just tomorrow, but for eternity.[lr]::
40469::$$$message_0273_0113_0001$$$::The Holy Grail War won't end.[lr]::
40470::$$$message_0273_0113_0002$$$::Assuming that, even if I die or she disappears...[lr]::
40471::$$$message_0273_0113_0003$$$::Life will keep on continuing like this.[lr]::
40472::$$$message_0273_0113_0004$$$::As long as the war doesn't end, and we don't wish for it to end,[lr]::
40473::$$$message_0273_0113_0005$$$::that promise will never need to be reduced to a wish.::
40474::$$$message_0273_0114_0000$$$::"...But, you won't allow that. Since you are not one who can hold back."[lr]::
40475::$$$message_0273_0114_0001$$$::It's a beautiful sunset.[lr]::
40476::$$$message_0273_0114_0002$$$::...No, that's not it.[lr]::
40477::$$$message_0273_0114_0003$$$::It's beautiful because she...::
40478::$$$message_0273_0115_0000$$$::"Isn't that correct?[lr]::
40479::$$$message_0273_0115_0001$$$::In this utopia where no one is lost.[lr]::
40480::$$$message_0273_0115_0002$$$::Only you are trying to find value in the lost things."[lr]::
40481::$$$message_0273_0115_0003$$$::...Most of all, she is the one that makes me feel like this sunset is beautiful.::
40482::$$$message_0273_0116_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
40483::$$$message_0273_0116_0001$$$::I finally get it.[lr]::
40484::$$$message_0273_0116_0002$$$::She didn't look down a single time today.[lr]::
40485::$$$message_0273_0116_0003$$$::She just saw off a promise, that would be obtainable if she wished, with a smile.::
40486::$$$message_0273_0117_0000$$$::"...Yeah. I'm going to settle this Holy Grail War."[lr]::
40487::$$$message_0273_0117_0001$$$::That self-righteousness.[lr]::
40488::$$$message_0273_0117_0002$$$::Really, there is no need to settle it.[lr]::
40489::$$$message_0273_0117_0003$$$::I can just sleep on the fourth day.[lr]::
40490::$$$message_0273_0117_0004$$$::I can just close my eyes and overlook these four days.[lr]::
40491::$$$message_0273_0117_0005$$$::This abnormality would end just from that.::
40492::$$$message_0273_0118_0000$$$::But, Shirou Emiya cannot do that.[lr]::
40493::$$$message_0273_0118_0001$$$::That would mean to ignore what was lost.[lr]::
40494::$$$message_0273_0118_0002$$$::That would be a way of living where one would submit to happiness and stop moving forward.[lr]::
40495::$$$message_0273_0118_0003$$$::A convenient happiness.[lr]::
40496::$$$message_0273_0118_0004$$$::A champion of justice, twisted to the bone, who can't accept this convenient truth.::
40497::$$$message_0273_0119_0000$$$::"Yes. You and many others would criticize it.[lr]::
40498::$$$message_0273_0119_0001$$$::But I think it is precious.[lr]::
40499::$$$message_0273_0119_0002$$$::You will end the Holy Grail War. Even if I try to save you by stopping you, the result most likely would not change."::
40500::$$$message_0273_0120_0000$$$::...That's why she didn't make a promise that she can't even keep.[lr]::
40501::$$$message_0273_0120_0001$$$::She smiles, as if witnessing a well-written story and not thinking about tomorrow.::
40502::$$$message_0273_0121_0000$$$::"...Do you think that's okay? My view is firm and stubborn."[lr]::
40503::$$$message_0273_0121_0001$$$::"Yes, I will continue protecting that pride.[lr]::
40504::$$$message_0273_0121_0002$$$::I shall be your sword until the end."[lr]::
40505::$$$message_0273_0121_0003$$$::But, this was a promise.[lr]::
40506::$$$message_0273_0121_0004$$$::As ones who vowed to fight together.[lr]::
40507::$$$message_0273_0121_0005$$$::She brilliantly severs that dream, without making me feel any regret.::
40508::$$$message_0273_0122_0000$$$::"Please do not make such a sad face.[lr]::
40509::$$$message_0273_0122_0001$$$::It is okay. Even if there is an end, it is not goodbye."[lr]::
40510::$$$message_0273_0122_0002$$$::"Not goodbye?"[lr]::
40511::$$$message_0273_0122_0003$$$::"Yes... We will all return to our respective futures that we wished for."::
40512::$$$message_0273_0123_0000$$$::That is true.[lr]::
40513::$$$message_0273_0123_0001$$$::I'm sure we'll find out what the future that we wished for might be once that never-ending night ends.[lr]::
40514::$$$message_0273_0123_0002$$$::   I have no fears.[lr]::
40515::$$$message_0273_0123_0003$$$::The brightest star on earth is encouraging me.::
40516::$$$message_0273_0124_0000$$$::"Let's go home, Saber.[lr]::
40517::$$$message_0273_0124_0001$$$::Thanks for today."[lr]::
40518::$$$message_0273_0124_0002$$$::"No, thank [font italic=true]you[font italic=false], Shirou."::
40519::$$$message_0273_0125_0000$$$::We resume walking.[lr]::
40520::$$$message_0273_0125_0001$$$::The day comes to an end.[lr]::
40521::$$$message_0273_0125_0002$$$::Now... If I wake up, I'll have to continue being someone who is worthy of this sword...:���